  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| eslint-plugin-jasmine | devDependencies | minor | `2.9.3` -> `2.10.1` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine</summary>\n\n### [`v2.10.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/releases/v2.10.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/compare/v2.10.0...v2.10.1)\n\n&lt;a name\"2.10.1\"></a>\n\n##### 2.10.1 (2018-05-17)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **rule:** allow done.fail in first argument of then ([76a524e1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/76a524e1))\n\n### [`v2.10.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/releases/v2.10.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/compare/v2.9.3...v2.10.0)\n\n&lt;a name\"2.10.0\"></a>\n\n#### 2.10.0 (2018-05-10)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **rule:** add rule to disallow promise without done.fail ([9bd0f76e](https://renovatebot.com/gh/tlvince/eslint-plugin-jasmine/commit/9bd0f76e))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
